  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MultiDonor Trust Fund for Cofinancing of the Public Expenditures for Administrative Capacity Endurance in Ukraine Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to co-finance Bank supported Expenditures for Administrative Capacity Endurance in Ukraine Project (PEACE) (P178946) (the Project), which aims to contribute to sustaining Ukraine&#x2019;s administrative and service delivery capacity to exercise core government functions at the national and regional levels.</narrative>
  </description>
